SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] Rural Communities Opioid Response Program - Overdose Response (FY27) — due
DESCRIPTION:One-year HRSA grants of up to $300K to meet urgent overdose and SUD needs in HRSA-designated rural areas. For-profits can apply directly\, and the last cycle listed clinical training (certification\, CEU/CME) as an allowable activity. More Therapy could apply itself with a MORE training and implementation package for rural OUD providers\, or a rural clinic or health system could apply and budget MORE training.\n\nPath: Direct/Sub · Priority 21.9\nhttps://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/6e9b19d6-ad0b-423f-830e-97341e72b6da
